From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000002 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anton <fourth@devpins.org>
Date: Wed, 3 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sdm845-xiaomi-beryllium: switchable USB DRD, host-first

Automatic USB OTG / Type-C role switching is incomplete on SDM845: the
PMI8998 has no mainline Type-C port controller (the qcom-pmic-typec driver
targets PM8150B/PMI632, not PMI8998) and there is no working usb-connector
graph, so the DWC3 controller never enters host mode on its own and a USB
DAC (Chord Mojo 2) fails to enumerate. The earlier revision of this patch
pinned dr_mode = "host" permanently, which fixed the DAC but made the port
electrically a host forever: no charging, no adb / usb-networking while
booted, and a permanent CX-rail vote (the standby drain the sleep hook
works around).

Instead put the controller in dual-role (otg) with the kernel USB
role-switch and a host-first default. CONFIG_USB_DWC3_DUAL_ROLE +
CONFIG_USB_ROLE_SWITCH then expose a writable /sys/class/usb_role/<dev>/role
that userspace flips between "host" / "device" / "none" at runtime -- the
standard *manual* DRD path, which works without a TCPM (only the
*automatic* cable detection is missing on beryllium). role-switch-default-mode
= "host" keeps the boot/resume default in host mode so the DAC still comes
up out of the box exactly as before; the userspace hifi-usb-mode switch
moves it to device mode on demand for charging / wired sync.

The properties live in the shared -common.dtsi, so this single change
covers both the EBBG and Tianma panel variants.

Signed-off-by: Anton <fourth@devpins.org>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm845-xiaomi-beryllium-common.dtsi | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm845-xiaomi-beryllium-common.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm845-xiaomi-beryllium-common.dtsi
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm845-xiaomi-beryllium-common.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm845-xiaomi-beryllium-common.dtsi
@@ -864,7 +864,9 @@
 };
 
 &usb_1_dwc3 {
-	dr_mode = "peripheral";
+	dr_mode = "otg";
+	usb-role-switch;
+	role-switch-default-mode = "host";
 };
 
 &usb_1_hsphy {
-- 
2.51.0

